The key distinction to verify is whether §2109.31 itself creates a right to pre-sale discovery or an evidentiary hearing, versus merely governing exceptions to a fiduciary account. Your factual allegations would ordinarily need to be specific and supported—not just a general demand for an audit—including:

- the fiduciary relationship and control over the funds;
